# 3. Entity Overview

The marketplace contains five primary entities:

| Entity    | Purpose                                             | Identifier   |
| --------- | --------------------------------------------------- | ------------ |
| `Buyer`   | Represents a person purchasing marketplace listings | Generated ID |
| `Seller`  | Represents a person or account offering listings    | Generated ID |
| `Listing` | Represents an item offered for purchase             | Generated ID |
| `Order`   | Represents a buyer's purchase of a listing          | Generated ID |
| `Review`  | Represents a buyer's review of a purchased listing  | Generated ID |

All five entities use generated, non-sequential identifiers.

This directly satisfies `REQ-ID-001`.

