# 20. Review Completion Rule

A review is only valid when its associated order is completed.

Conceptually:

```text
Review
   ↓
Order
   ↓
status = COMPLETED
```

This is a business rule rather than a simple foreign-key constraint.

The service/API layer SHALL verify that:

```text
Order.status = COMPLETED
```

before allowing review creation.

The database relationship guarantees that the referenced order exists.

The application transaction guarantees that the order is in the required lifecycle state.

