# 32. Invalid States Made Impossible

The database should prevent or reject the following invalid states.

| Invalid State                         | Enforcement                   |
| ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |
| Listing references nonexistent seller | Foreign key                   |
| Order references nonexistent buyer    | Foreign key                   |
| Order references nonexistent listing  | Foreign key                   |
| Review references nonexistent buyer   | Foreign key                   |
| Review references nonexistent listing | Foreign key                   |
| Review references nonexistent order   | Foreign key                   |
| Two reviews for one order             | Unique `orderId`              |
| Order quantity is zero                | Check constraint              |
| Order quantity is negative            | Check constraint              |
| Negative listing price                | Check constraint              |
| Negative order price                  | Check constraint              |
| Review rating below 1                 | Check constraint              |
| Review rating above 5                 | Check constraint              |
| Invalid lifecycle value               | Enum/check constraint         |
| Sequential public IDs                 | Generated identifier strategy |

Trace:

```text
REQ-CONSTRAINT-005
