# 33. Business Rules That Require Application-Level Enforcement

Not every rule can be represented cleanly using a simple foreign key or check constraint.

The following rules SHALL be enforced by the service/API transaction layer.

## Rule 1 — Review Requires Completed Order

Before creating a review:

```text
Order.status === COMPLETED
```

---

## Rule 2 — Review Buyer Must Match Order Buyer

The review's:

```text
buyerId
```

must match:

```text
order.buyerId
```

---

## Rule 3 — Review Listing Must Match Order Listing

The review's:

```text
listingId
```

must match:

```text
order.listingId
```

This prevents a buyer from using an unrelated completed order to review another listing.

---

## Rule 4 — Valid State Transitions

Listing and order state transitions must be validated before updating the state.

Trace:

```text
