# 45. Model Invariants

The following invariants must always hold.

```text
Invariant 1:
Every Listing has exactly one Seller.

Invariant 2:
Every Order has exactly one Buyer.

Invariant 3:
Every Order has exactly one Listing.

Invariant 4:
Every Review has exactly one Buyer.

Invariant 5:
Every Review has exactly one Listing.

Invariant 6:
Every Review has exactly one Order.

Invariant 7:
An Order can have at most one Review.

Invariant 8:
A Review requires a COMPLETED Order.

Invariant 9:
Order quantity must be greater than zero.

Invariant 10:
Ratings must be between 1 and 5.

Invariant 11:
Monetary values are integer minor units.

Invariant 12:
Every entity identifier is generated and non-sequential.
```

